# Quiet workspace review cohort: 20 common paths, one uncommon path, one unmapped event.
# Generate fresh real protobufs with task demo:workspace or:
# go run ./cmd/fixtures workspace-generate (with .sentrame/local.env exported).
# REST Client variables use rest/.env. Bodies/credentials stay ignored in generated/.
# Send requests in order; repeating either ingestion preserves exact IDs/bytes.

### Owner login
# @expect 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

< ./generated/workspace-login.json

### Standard browser OTLP ingestion: 21 closed journeys and one unmapped event
# @expect 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{browserToken}}

< ./generated/workspace.bin

### Identical replay: counts must remain 20 common paths and one rare path
# @expect 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{browserToken}}

< ./generated/workspace.bin

### Same protected read path used by the graph workspace
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot?scope={{workspaceScope}}

### Independent occurrence-time histogram context for the same fresh scope
# @expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timeline?window=1h&scope={{workspaceScope}}
